plugin-db (0.4.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * plugin_db_constants.h, a new header rendered from data/constants.json:
    the length of a digest in hex, PLUGIN_DB_PIN_SHA256_HEX_LEN, for a
    consumer that needs it without OpenSSL; pin.h names it
    PHD_SHA256_HEX_LEN as before.

