plugin-db (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * python3-plugin-db, a new package: the reader in Python, the same records
    and verdict tiers as the C and TypeScript readers.
  * Catalogs: the Catalan entries are a person's (by: human); es, fr, de, it
    and pt are made from the English source sentences. text() reads them
    through omx-contract's own catalog reader.
  * One language pack per listed language, plugin-db-l10n-<lang>, each its
    one catalog.
  * The release builds the DEBs beside the RPMs; a staged run publishes to
    the staging channel.
  * Built against and requires omx-contract >= 3.17.0 and << 4.

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:30:00 +0100

