plugin-db (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A bundle directory with a space is matched against its own file:// IRI:
    the IRI is decoded once before the match ("my amp.lv2" is my%20amp.lv2).
  * The pin path codec is plugin-hostd-protocol's phd_pin_path_encode and
    phd_pin_path_decode; plugin-db's own pdb_percent_decode and
    percent_encode are gone. A file name is escaped as the protocol says: a
    quote, a backslash and control bytes too, and UTF-8 bytes no longer.
  * Builds against plugin-hostd-protocol-devel >= 0.4.1 and < 0.5.

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 22:30:00 +0100

